{{ 'suntneew-a3-pdp.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section id="features" class="sn-a3-pdp" aria-labelledby="a3-experience-heading-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="sn-a3-pdp__shell sn-a3-pdp__section">
    <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">A3 PERFORMANCE</p>
    <h2 class="sn-a3-pdp__heading" id="a3-experience-heading-{{ section.id }}">Power for the moment your vehicle will not start.</h2>
    <p class="sn-a3-pdp__lede">A3 keeps emergency starting, fast device power and practical roadside light in one complete 12V kit.</p>

    <div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-stack">
      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__wide">
        <img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-starting-wide.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 jump starter connected in a vehicle engine bay" width="1958" height="803" loading="lazy">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-copy">
          <div>
            <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">EMERGENCY STARTING POWER</p>
            <h3>Ready when your battery is not.</h3>
            <p>Designed for compatible 12V vehicle systems, A3 puts starting power and a guided smart-clamp connection in one travel-ready kit.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metrics" aria-label="A3 starting performance">
            <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>2500A</strong><span>Peak current</span></div>
            <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>800A</strong><span>Starting current</span></div>
            <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>8.0L / 6.5L</strong><span>Gas / diesel capacity</span></div>
            <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>50+</strong><span>Starts per full charge</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__wide">
        <img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-pd60w-wide.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 charging a laptop and phone through its USB-C port" width="1958" height="803" loading="lazy">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__wide-copy">
          <div>
            <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">PD 60W FAST CHARGING</p>
            <h3>Power for more than the roadside.</h3>
            <p>Use the A3 USB-C power connection for compatible devices when you need portable power away from a wall outlet.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metrics" aria-label="A3 power delivery">
            <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>PD 60W</strong><span>USB-C input and output</span></div>
            <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>USB-C</strong><span>Power Delivery connection</span></div>
            <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>USB-A ×2</strong><span>Additional USB outputs</span></div>
            <div class="sn-a3-pdp__metric"><strong>59.2Wh</strong><span>Rated energy</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="sn-a3-pdp__feature-stack">
      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__feature">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-light.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 integrated LED light in a roadside setting" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__feature-copy">
          <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">150 LM LED LIGHT</p>
          <h3>Light when the road goes dark.</h3>
          <p>Integrated lighting gives the A3 a practical place in the vehicle kit, from routine checks to an unexpected roadside stop.</p>
          <ul class="sn-a3-pdp__mode-list" aria-label="Light modes"><li>Steady</li><li>Strobe</li><li>SOS</li></ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__feature sn-a3-pdp__feature--reverse">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-display.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 battery and power status display" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__feature-copy">
          <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">AT-A-GLANCE STATUS</p>
          <h3>Know the power state before you begin.</h3>
          <p>The real-time display shows battery percentage and active input or output information directly on the unit.</p>
          <ul class="sn-a3-pdp__kit-list"><li>Battery percentage</li><li><strong>IN</strong> while the A3 is charging</li><li><strong>OUT</strong> during active output</li></ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="how-it-works" class="sn-a3-pdp__steps sn-a3-pdp__section">
    <div class="sn-a3-pdp__shell">
      <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</p>
      <h2 class="sn-a3-pdp__heading">Four clear steps before you start.</h2>
      <p class="sn-a3-pdp__lede">Use this as a visual overview, then follow the A3 manual and the vehicle manufacturer’s instructions for the complete procedure.</p>
      <div class="sn-a3-pdp__step-grid">
        <article class="sn-a3-pdp__step"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-step-01.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Insert the smart-clamp plug into A3" width="341" height="380" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__step-copy"><span class="sn-a3-pdp__step-number">STEP 01</span><h3>Connect the smart clamp.</h3><p>Insert the clamp plug fully into the A3.</p></div></article>
        <article class="sn-a3-pdp__step"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-step-02.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Connect smart clamps to a vehicle battery" width="341" height="380" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__step-copy"><span class="sn-a3-pdp__step-number">STEP 02</span><h3>Attach the clamps.</h3><p>Connect positive and negative clamps to the correct battery terminals.</p></div></article>
        <article class="sn-a3-pdp__step"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-step-03.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="A3 smart clamp green operating light" width="341" height="380" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__step-copy"><span class="sn-a3-pdp__step-number">STEP 03</span><h3>Check the green light.</h3><p>Confirm the clamp’s operating indication before starting.</p></div></article>
        <article class="sn-a3-pdp__step"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-step-04.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Press vehicle engine start button" width="338" height="380" loading="lazy"><div class="sn-a3-pdp__step-copy"><span class="sn-a3-pdp__step-number">STEP 04</span><h3>Start the vehicle.</h3><p>Start the compatible vehicle, then follow the manual for disconnection.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="safety" class="sn-a3-pdp__section">
    <div class="sn-a3-pdp__shell">
      <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">SMART CLAMP SAFETY</p>
      <h2 class="sn-a3-pdp__heading">Eight safeguards around the connection.</h2>
      <p class="sn-a3-pdp__safety-note">A3 communicates the connection state through the clamp module. Confirm polarity and follow all vehicle and product instructions before each use.</p>
      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__feature sn-a3-pdp__safety-feature">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-smart-clamp.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 intelligent jumper clamps connected to the jump starter" width="1254" height="1254" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__feature-copy">
          <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">INTELLIGENT JUMPER CLAMPS</p>
          <h3>Clear connection feedback before you start.</h3>
          <p>The clamp module is the connection point between the A3 and a compatible vehicle battery. Check the connection indication, then follow the full procedure in the user manual.</p>
          <ul class="sn-a3-pdp__kit-list"><li>Confirm clamp polarity before starting</li><li>Check the operating indication</li><li>Disconnect in the order specified in the manual</li></ul>
        </div>
      </article>
      <div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguards" aria-label="Eight A3 protection functions">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>01</strong><span>Spark-proof protection</span></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>02</strong><span>Overtime protection</span></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>03</strong><span>Low-voltage protection</span></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>04</strong><span>High-temperature protection</span></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>05</strong><span>Short-circuit protection</span></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>06</strong><span>Reverse-polarity protection</span></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>07</strong><span>Reverse-connection protection</span></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__safeguard"><strong>08</strong><span>Over-current protection</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sn-a3-pdp__shell sn-a3-pdp__section">
    <div class="sn-a3-pdp__range">
      <div><p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">OPERATING RANGE</p><h2>Built for the temperature swing.</h2><p>The aluminum-alloy A3 shell and documented operating range help keep the kit ready for changing road conditions.</p></div>
      <div class="sn-a3-pdp__range-value">-20°C to 60°C<span>Working temperature</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sn-a3-pdp__applications" aria-label="Compatible vehicle categories">
      <div>
        <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">COMPATIBLE 12V VEHICLE TYPES</p>
        <h2>One compact kit for everyday vehicle categories.</h2>
      </div>
      <ul><li>Cars</li><li>SUVs</li><li>Pickups</li><li>Motorcycles</li><li>Boats</li></ul>
      <p>Compatibility depends on the vehicle’s 12V system, engine size, battery condition and operating temperature. Refer to the manual before use.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="a3-kit" class="sn-a3-pdp__section">
    <div class="sn-a3-pdp__shell">
      <article class="sn-a3-pdp__feature">
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__feature-media"><img src="{{ 'suntneew-a3-rebuild-kit.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="SuntNeew A3 kit including carry case, smart clamps and USB-C cable" width="2000" height="2000" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="sn-a3-pdp__feature-copy">
          <p class="sn-a3-pdp__eyebrow">IN THE BOX</p>
          <h3>Everything stays together for the next drive.</h3>
          <p>The core tools are shown together so you can see what belongs in the A3 travel kit.</p>
          <ul class="sn-a3-pdp__kit-list"><li>A3 jump starter</li><li>Intelligent jumper clamps</li><li>PD 60W USB-C cable</li><li>EVA carry case</li><li>User manual</li></ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

